            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Codex Whip 1.10.1

A designed installer window.

• Opening the download now shows the Codex Whip blueprint, an arrow to Applications and readable labels in light and dark mode.
• The first-launch step for macOS's security check is printed right in the window.

If you updated to 1.10.0, nothing else changes. Coming from 1.9 or earlier, turn Start at Login and Automatic Updates on again once from the menu.

macOS 14 or later. This community build is ad hoc signed and is not Apple-notarized.
]]></description>
